that transforms your pain into power.

255
00:56:41.959 --> 00:56:45.999
The more you suffer,
the more you get drunk.

256
00:56:46.084 --> 00:56:49.916
That's the heart and soul of Meyraiyuth.

257
00:56:51.084 --> 00:56:52.083
So, it means. . .

258
00:56:52.167 --> 00:56:56.249
The happy ones
will never master the art of Meyraiyuth.

259
00:56:57.375 --> 00:57:01.708
Sorry, kid, but your life is
as miserable as ours.

260
00:57:18.042 --> 00:57:20.374
lf you've decided not to help,

261
00:57:20.459 --> 00:57:23.791
no one could blame you.

262
