any kidnapped special targets
will be sold to the Jaguar Gang.

290
00:59:58.125 --> 01:00:02.374
These sons of bitches,
they've got loads of money.

291
01:00:03.209 --> 01:00:04.666
Special targets?

292
01:00:08.042 --> 01:00:13.124
People like you, like Pie, get their attention.

293
01:00:13.209 --> 01:00:17.166
They use these people
to produce an expensive perfume.

294
01:00:17.250 --> 01:00:19.708
Not just expensive but filthy expensive.

295
01:00:19.792 --> 01:00:21.624
Perfume?

296
01:00:23.334 --> 01:00:24.999
What does it have to do with me?

297
01:00:26.709 --> 01:00:29.333
Because the perfume comes
from human beings.

298
01:00:30.125 --> 01:00:34.416
ln our body,
there's a substance called "Pheromone".

299
01:00:34.500 --> 01:00:36.499
Have you heard about it, "Pheromone"?

300
01:00:37.500 --> 01:00:41.166
Pheromone works without your awareness.

301
