305
01:00:55.417 --> 01:00:57.041
A very special perfume.

306
01:00:57.125 --> 01:01:02.499
Anyone who gets a sniff
will be spellbound, addicted to it.

307
01:01:02.584 --> 01:01:05.583
And will be addicted to sex.

308
01:01:05.667 --> 01:01:07.916
lt's like a toy for rich people.

309
01:01:08.792 --> 01:01:11.083
- And you said that l . . .
- Right.

310
01:01:11.167 --> 01:01:13.458
You possess that special substance.

311
