That's why we chose you.

312
01:01:21.750 --> 01:01:23.624
lt hasn't been extracted yet.

313
01:01:24.917 --> 01:01:29.499
lt needs someone with
an extraordinary sense of smell, a sniffer.

314
01:01:30.959 --> 01:01:34.458
Yes, it's me.
l used to be a sniffer for the police.

315
01:01:34.542 --> 01:01:37.416
My work led to the arrest
of many of the gangs.

316
01:01:38.250 --> 01:01:41.958
