But the police haven't been able
to catch any of these bastards.

318
01:01:54.167 --> 01:01:56.624
So my brother and l
took matters into our own hands.

319
01:01:56.709 --> 01:01:59.833
l'm sorry about your wife.
But there's something l'm curious about.

320
01:02:01.292 --> 01:02:02.624
What kind of smell am l?

321
