Do l turn people into. . . sex addicts?

322
01:02:10.625 --> 01:02:14.291
How would l know?
l've never used it. Just go ask them.

323
01:02:18.542 --> 01:02:19.874
lt's a "no way out" plan.

324
01:02:19.959 --> 01:02:24.583
There's more than one of them.
Nobody knows what they look like.

325
01:02:24.667 --> 01:02:28.874
Your job is to go out and wait.
Could be days or months. Who knows.

326
01:02:28.875 --> 01:02:31.041
As soon as they're in the area. . .

327
01:02:33.334 --> 01:02:35.374
. .they'll recognise your smell.

328
01:02:37.959 --> 01:02:39.833
They're sure to grab you.

329
01:05:30.959 --> 01:05:32.166
Shit.

330
01:06:56.667 --> 01:06:59.458
- Where's Deu?
- They took her away.

331
