They knew she was a bait,
but took her anyway.

332
01:07:04.125 --> 01:07:06.374
Shit. Where's Sanim?

333
01:07:15.500 --> 01:07:17.249
Let them take her.

334
01:07:17.334 --> 01:07:21.041
l'll follow them to their lair.

335
01:07:21.125 --> 01:07:23.874
Rescue Deu and Pie .

336
01:07:23.959 --> 01:07:26.208
l'll destroy their cell.

337
01:07:26.292 --> 01:07:28.999
No one will have to suffer
because of them again.

338
