344
01:08:48.875 --> 01:08:50.458
Deu.

345
01:09:59.792 --> 01:10:02.208
How come this one is so stubborn?

346
01:10:02.292 --> 01:10:06.166
The drug has had no effect on her.

347
01:10:06.167 --> 01:10:08.833
Stream her one more time.

348
01:12:30.209 --> 01:12:33.041
Because the perfume
comes from human beings.

349
01:12:33.125 --> 01:12:37.708
ln our body ,
there's a substance called "Pheromone" .

350
