Go rescue Pie first.

358
01:20:46.625 --> 01:20:50.208
WeIcome to the garden of flowers.

359
01:20:51.250 --> 01:20:57.958
Their tears are the pollen ,
so fragrant beyond description.

360
01:20:58.042 --> 01:21:02.708
You are one of them.
Don't you know how rare you are?

361
01:21:07.834 --> 01:21:10.374
As rare as my favourite bride .

362
01:25:23.625 --> 01:25:24.999
Pie.

363
